        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. The remaining leaders of the Velvet Vanguard have fled to the secluded GAMA facility in Hokkaido for final sanctuary. We must eliminate their inner circle to permanently dismantle the syndicate.\r\rEliminate the targets:\r• Nakamura (The Director)\r• Laurent (The Chief Surgeon)\r• Ito (The Curator)\r• Portman (The Elite Asset)\r• Dexter (The Underworld Backer)\r\rEnd the Vanguard once and for all. Good luck.",
